{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45716","headline":"送卢舍人三首 二 · 贯休","name":"送卢舍人三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二曰：劝君登商山，不用觅商山皓。\n云深雪深骡马倒，我愿终南太华变爲金。\n吾后见之不爲宝，我愿九州四海纸。\n幅幅与君爲谏草，使蹑卨践夔。\n逢轩见皞，日环五色。\n是物得老，如此即商山皓。\n商山皓，君不用讨他，他必来相讨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45716.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45716","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}